  "research_question": "Does modelling delivery-level outcomes and simulating the over provide useful information about explosive 15+ and 20+ overs that the production model misses?",
  "answer": "Largely no. The champion already carried tail signal in its bucket probabilities (AUC 0.648 for 15+, 0.698 for 20+). The simulator improves 15+ ranking marginally and significantly (+0.0146 AUC), improves 20+ ranking non-significantly (+0.0184), degrades explosive-over point accuracy, and leaves 20+ argmax recall at zero for both models. The genuine win is a better calibrated and narrower prediction interval.",
